description	"Poe Dameron

The guy you need when someone, somehow returns.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Custom Glie-44 Blaster Pistol (Pistol 3)
-- 15% more damage / 25% higher FP drain
-- 20% higher bolt velocity
-- 20% faster fire rate
- EL-16HFE Blaster Rifle (M5 2 + Scope)
-- 15% higher bolt velocity
-- 20% faster fire rate
- Frag Grenades (2)
- Magnetic Pulse Grenade (2)
-- Disarms and pulls on detonation
- Thermal Detonator (1)

^8Attributes:
- Healing (2)
- Anti MT (1)
- Sentry Turret (Inventory)
- Tracking Beacon
- Stamina (3)
- Stat Viewer
- Dexterity (1)
- Rally 
- Knockdown Roll

^3Abilities:
- Sprint (3) ^3[CS2]
- Dash (2) ^3[CS3]
- Plan Ahead (Resource Dispenser 3) ^3[USE In Melee]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS4]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]"